# CG-Agent Ollama Modelfile.
#
# Two uses:
#  1. System-prompt path (no training): FROM qwen3.8:27b-mlx + the CG-Agent system
#     prompt. `ollama create cgagent -f finetune/Modelfile.cgagent` gives you the
#     stock multimodal model with repo-aware prompting.
#  2. GGUF re-export path (after fine-tuning): mlx-vlm has no fuse command, so you
#     must fuse the LoRA into the base weights manually (llama.cpp or a safetensors
#     merge), convert the fused model to GGUF, then `ollama create cgagent-fused -f
#     finetune/Modelfile.cgagent` after changing FROM to your fused GGUF file.
#
# The fine-tuned LoRA is NOT served via Ollama here. The primary serve path is
# `mlx_vlm.server --model mlx-community/Qwen3.8-27B-4bit --adapter-path ./adapters`
# (loopback, OpenAI-compatible, adapter applied live — no fuse step). Wire both
# models.local_llm and agentic.deepagent_github at that loopback URL instead.
FROM qwen3.8:27b-mlx
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
